      "text": "さざなみCosense",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1793649029,
      "updated": 1793649029
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae8e98400000000002087c9",
      "text": "さざなみのように波紋が広がる",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1793649029,
      "updated": 1793649039
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae8e98f00000000002087ca",
      "text": "さざなみのような思考の連鎖",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1793649039,
      "updated": 1793649039
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae8e98f00000000002087cb",
      "text": "思いもよらないアイデアや過去の記憶と繋がっていく",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1793649039,
      "updated": 1793649039
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae8e98f00000000002087cc",
      "text": "水面に石を投げ入れたときのような情報伝播",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1793649039,
      "updated": 1793649039
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae8e98f00000000002087cd",
      "text": "[2 hop link]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1793649039,
      "updated": 1793649060
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae9bfb10000000000b33512",
      "text": "[セレンディピティ] - 幸運を見つける能力",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1793703857,
      "updated": 1793703859
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae9bfb20000000000b33513",
      "text": "[デフォルトモードネットワーク]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1793703859,
      "updated": 1793703859
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae9bfb20000000000b33514",
      "text": "[ひらめき]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1793703859,
      "updated": 1793703859
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae9bfb20000000000b33515",
      "text": "[波及効果]、リップルエフェクト（ripple effect）",
